# Reference material, not source.
#
# The demo recording of another provider's kitchen screen is 11MB of video that
# the build never reads and that would sit in every clone of this repository
# forever. It lives beside this file on the machine that needs it; the notes
# taken from it are in docs/reference-kitchen-demo.md, which is what anybody
# working on the board actually needs.
VesopaKitchenDemo.MP4
